# 🎮 Exploratory Data Analysis of Video Game Sales

## 📌 Project Overview
This project focuses on performing Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) on a video game sales dataset.  
The goal is to understand trends in global gaming sales across different platforms, genres, publishers, and regions.

---

## 📊 Objectives
- Analyze global video game sales trends
- Identify top-performing platforms, genres, and publishers
- Understand regional sales distribution (NA, EU, JP, Other)
- Visualize insights using charts and graphs

---

## 📁 Dataset Information
The dataset contains the following columns:

- Name
- Platform
- Year
- Genre
- Publisher
- NorthAmerica_Sales
- Europe_Sales
- Japan_Sales
- Other_Sales
- Global_Sales

---

## 🛠️ Tools & Technologies Used
- Python 🐍
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn
- Jupyter Notebook

---

## 📈 Key Analysis Performed
- Top 10 most global_sales game
- Total Global Sales by Genre
- top 10 Years with Highest Video Game Sales
- total contribution of genre in Japan_sales
- platform wise top 10 game
- Top 5 Platforms by Global Sales
- top 5 years with highest publisher
- Top 10 publisher by other_sales

